  "problem": "Humans could not compare selected sources using the same evidence as compare_assets. Unknown or incomparable dimensions could disappear behind a numeric quality score. A disabled planner could look like compilation occurred. Negotiated rates could be mistaken for patient bills. A selected pair could look joinable without a documented route.",
